                                                "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                                "args": {
                                                  "text": [
                                                    "Slush: I still\nprefer a building\nwith my name on\nit. But a city\nthat",
                                                    "works is a better\nneighbor than an\nestate surrounded\nby cold. He",
                                                    "offers the\numbrella to Pip,\nwho discovers it\nis heavy because\nthe",
                                                    "handle stores\ntwelve emergency\nforms."
